        "quote": "Here, the defendant established its prima facie entitlement to summary judgment by demonstrating that the plaintiff could not identify the cause of her fall ( see Trapani v Yonkers Racing Corp. , 124 AD3d 628 , 629 [2015]; Patrick v Costco Wholesale Corp. , 77 AD3d at 811; Scott v Rochdale Vil., Inc. , 65 AD3d 621 [2009]; Costantino v Webel , 57 AD3d 472 [2008]).",
